    {
     "id": "18f1a536",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "text-editor",
     "settings": {
      "editor": "<p style=\"margin:0;max-width:615px;\">Obviously some classic Aussie mullets were a must, as well as one of each vehicle…</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:20px;max-width:615px;\">79 series cruiser, 80 series cruiser, GU Patrol, GQ Patrol &amp; a D22 Navara.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:20px;max-width:615px;\">On the day of the shoot, our crew met Mullet Mods team on their family property on the Sunshine Coast. With all the rain we’ve had on the east coast, the grassy grounds by the river we had previously chosen as our location would quickly become a bottomless mud pit. This meant we only had one take to get the placement of the cars dialled as we could not drive back over our wheel tracks twice!</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:20px;max-width:615px;\">After a full day of shooting, our camera operators began dicing and splicing the loads of content we filmed. Through some digging, we turned up some fantastic imagery and videography that Mullet Mods was absolutely stoked with.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:20px;max-width:615px;\">We made their vision a reality by creating high-quality product imagery to fill their website and socials.</p>",
      "text_color": "#55575C",
      "typography_typography": "custom",
      "typography_font_family": "Montserrat",
      "typography_font_size": {
       "unit": "px",
       "size": 16
      },
      "typography_line_height": {
       "unit": "px",
       "size": 26.88
      }
     },
